        "question_id": "q-134035",
        "problem": "Margaret and Ivana each bought $3$ blackberry muffins and $5$ strawberry muffins. In total, they bought$\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,$muffins.",
